      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Whitby%2C_Ontario",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Whitby’s historic Centennial Building houses the Courthouse Theatre, a venue that has staged live performances for over a century.",
