      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Founded in 1966, the Whitby Yacht Club offers racing, cruising, and sail training on Lake Ontario’s waters.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        22
